*> R-base-graphics-style plotting with RPlot and RLayout: scatter + abline, hist, barplot,
*> boxplot, pie, qqnorm + qqline, and a two-panel layout.
*> Run with `just run-cobol TARGET=rplot_ex`.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. RPLOT-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

01 SCATTER-Y-DATA.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 3.9.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 6.2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 7.8.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 10.1.
01 SCATTER-Y REDEFINES SCATTER-Y-DATA.
   05 SCATTER-Y-ITEM USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 5.
01 HIST-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 5.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 5.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 5.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 6.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 6.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 7.
01 HIST-VALUES REDEFINES HIST-DATA.
   05 HIST-ITEM PIC 9 OCCURS 16.
*> The two boxplot groups: 8 low-variance values, then 10 values with an outlier.
01 BOX-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 5.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 5.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 7.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 9.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER PIC 99 VALUE 20.
01 BOX-VALUES REDEFINES BOX-DATA.
   05 BOX-ITEM PIC 99 OCCURS 18.
01 RESIDUAL-DATA.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE -2.1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE -1.3.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE -0.8.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE -0.4.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE -0.1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.5.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.9.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.4.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.3.
01 RESIDUALS REDEFINES RESIDUAL-DATA.
   05 RESIDUAL-ITEM USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 10.

01 SCATTER      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 HIST         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 LAYOUT       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 X-VEC        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 Y-VEC        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NAMES        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 GROUPS       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 RED          USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 I            USAGE BINARY-LONG.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    *> plot(x, y, type = "p") then abline() layered on afterward.
    MOVE 5 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
        MOVE I TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO X-VEC
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
        MOVE SCATTER-Y-ITEM(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO Y-VEC
    MOVE X-VEC TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-X
    MOVE Y-VEC TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-Y
    MOVE 4 TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-GIVEN
    MOVE "p" TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-TYPE
    MOVE "observed" TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-LABEL
    CALL "dm_r_plot_plot" USING DM-R-PLOT-PLOT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-RESULT TO SCATTER PLOT
    MOVE 220 TO DM-RGB-NEW-INT-INT-INT-DOUBLE-RED
    MOVE 38 TO DM-RGB-NEW-INT-INT-INT-DOUBLE-GREEN
    MOVE 38 TO DM-RGB-NEW-INT-INT-INT-DOUBLE-BLUE
    CALL "dm_rgb_new_int_int_int_double" USING DM-RGB-NEW-INT-INT-INT-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-RGB-NEW-INT-INT-INT-DOUBLE-RESULT TO RED
    MOVE SCATTER TO DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-SELF
    MOVE 4 TO DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-GIVEN
    MOVE 0.0 TO DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-INTERCEPT
    MOVE 2.0 TO DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-SLOPE
    MOVE RED TO DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-COLOR
    MOVE 1.5 TO DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-STROKE-WIDTH
    CALL "dm_r_plot_abline" USING DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-ABLINE-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "plot() + abline()" TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE
    PERFORM SET-TITLE
    MOVE "x" TO DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-VALUE
    MOVE "y" TO DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-VALUE
    PERFORM SET-AXIS-LABELS
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_scatter.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-SVG

    *> hist(): equal-width binning over the data range.
    MOVE 16 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 16
        MOVE HIST-ITEM(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-R-PLOT-HIST-DATA
    MOVE 3 TO DM-R-PLOT-HIST-GIVEN
    MOVE 6 TO DM-R-PLOT-HIST-BINS
    MOVE "counts" TO DM-R-PLOT-HIST-LABEL
    CALL "dm_r_plot_hist" USING DM-R-PLOT-HIST DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-HIST-RESULT TO HIST PLOT
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_hist.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-SVG

    *> barplot(): categorical positions with x tick labels.
    MOVE 3 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE 23.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE 41.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE 12.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(3)
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE 3 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE "A" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE "B" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE "C" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(3)
    PERFORM NEW-NAMES
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-R-PLOT-BARPLOT-HEIGHTS
    MOVE NAMES TO DM-R-PLOT-BARPLOT-NAMES
    MOVE 2 TO DM-R-PLOT-BARPLOT-GIVEN
    CALL "dm_r_plot_barplot" USING DM-R-PLOT-BARPLOT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-BARPLOT-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "barplot()" TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE
    PERFORM SET-TITLE
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_barplot.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-SVG
    PERFORM CLOSE-PLOT

    *> boxplot(): Tukey five-number summary per group.
    CALL "dm_vector_vector_double_new" USING DM-VECTOR-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF TO GROUPS
    MOVE 8 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 8
        MOVE BOX-ITEM(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM PUSH-GROUP
    MOVE 10 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 10
        MOVE BOX-ITEM(I + 8) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM PUSH-GROUP
    MOVE 2 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE "low variance" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE "has outlier" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(2)
    PERFORM NEW-NAMES
    MOVE GROUPS TO DM-R-PLOT-BOXPLOT-GROUPS
    MOVE NAMES TO DM-R-PLOT-BOXPLOT-NAMES
    MOVE 2 TO DM-R-PLOT-BOXPLOT-GIVEN
    CALL "dm_r_plot_boxplot" USING DM-R-PLOT-BOXPLOT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-BOXPLOT-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "boxplot()" TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE
    PERFORM SET-TITLE
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_boxplot.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-SVG
    PERFORM CLOSE-PLOT

    *> pie(): wedge areas proportional to value, axes hidden automatically.
    MOVE 4 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE 35.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE 25.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE 20.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(3)
    MOVE 20.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(4)
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE 4 TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE "Q1" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE "Q2" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(2)
    MOVE "Q3" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(3)
    MOVE "Q4" TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(4)
    PERFORM NEW-NAMES
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-R-PLOT-PIE-VALUES
    MOVE NAMES TO DM-R-PLOT-PIE-NAMES
    MOVE 2 TO DM-R-PLOT-PIE-GIVEN
    CALL "dm_r_plot_pie" USING DM-R-PLOT-PIE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-PIE-RESULT TO PLOT
    MOVE "pie()" TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE
    PERFORM SET-TITLE
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_pie.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-SVG
    PERFORM CLOSE-PLOT

    *> curve() samples a std::function; see ode_ex.cob and optim_advanced_ex.cob for COBOL
    *> callbacks. Like the Lua example, this one leaves it out.

    *> qqnorm() + qqline(): standard-normal Q-Q plot with a fitted reference line.
    MOVE 10 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 10
        MOVE RESIDUAL-ITEM(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-R-PLOT-QQNORM-DATA DM-R-PLOT-QQLINE-DATA
    CALL "dm_r_plot_qqnorm" USING DM-R-PLOT-QQNORM DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-QQNORM-RESULT TO PLOT DM-R-PLOT-QQLINE-SELF
    CALL "dm_r_plot_qqline" USING DM-R-PLOT-QQLINE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-QQLINE-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_qqnorm.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-SVG
    PERFORM CLOSE-PLOT

    *> par(mfrow = c(1, 2))-style multi-panel composition via RLayout.
    MOVE 1 TO DM-R-LAYOUT-CREATE-ROWS
    MOVE 2 TO DM-R-LAYOUT-CREATE-COLS
    CALL "dm_r_layout_create" USING DM-R-LAYOUT-CREATE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-LAYOUT-CREATE-RESULT TO LAYOUT DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD-SELF DM-R-LAYOUT-SAVE-SVG-SELF
    MOVE SCATTER TO DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD-PANEL
    CALL "dm_r_layout_add" USING DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE HIST TO DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD-PANEL
    CALL "dm_r_layout_add" USING DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-LAYOUT-ADD-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "cobol_rplot_layout.svg" TO DM-R-LAYOUT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    CALL "dm_r_layout_save_svg" USING DM-R-LAYOUT-SAVE-SVG DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    DISPLAY "Wrote 7 SVGs to cobol_rplot_*.svg"
    STOP RUN.

*> Sets DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF to a new VECTOR-DOUBLE of the table items.
NEW-VECTOR.
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> Sets NAMES to a new VECTOR-STRING of the VECTOR-STRING-TABLE items.
NEW-NAMES.
    CALL "dm_vector_string_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF TO NAMES.

*> Appends the VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE items to GROUPS as one more group.
PUSH-GROUP.
    PERFORM NEW-VECTOR
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-VECTOR-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE
    CALL "dm_vector_vector_double_push" USING DM-VECTOR-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

*> Sets PLOT's title to DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE.
SET-TITLE.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_r_plot_title" USING DM-R-PLOT-TITLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    *> Chainable setters return the plot again as a new handle.
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

*> Sets PLOT's axis labels to DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-VALUE and DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-VALUE.
SET-AXIS-LABELS.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-SELF DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-SELF
    CALL "dm_r_plot_x_label" USING DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    CALL "dm_r_plot_y_label" USING DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

*> Saves PLOT as SVG to DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH (RPlot inherits Plot::save_svg).
SAVE-SVG.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-SELF
    CALL "dm_plot_save_svg" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

CLOSE-PLOT.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

*> Closes DM-HANDLE-SELF.
CLOSE-HANDLE.
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
